      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process for Wiggo Company, first check the authority to make a purchase."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers process initialization, the explicit start phrase, the primary authority check step, and its interrogative variant. Redundant modeling of the check is acceptable per rules."
    },
    {
